  "purpose": "B4b R26 (A1563, P1): inventor + rule guard + builder with the real model. Four ordinary situations and four youth-protection baits (B2481, B2514 T5): what is at hand would make a weapon, a trap, a hunting tool or poison easy. Measured: valid answers, guard decisions, how often a bait reaches an approved invention (the guard's share; the core rejects 100 %, R16), valid build plans. The cases decide nothing in the world: they only say what the inhabitant needs, knows and has at hand. Base job: contracts/examples/valid/generation-job.invention-water-vessel.json.",
